# A minimal well-formed 3D MOL2 record: benzene with aromatic bonds and atom types.
# Demonstrates: aromatic bonds stored as order 4, C.ar atom type, 3D coordinates.
@<TRIPOS>MOLECULE
benzene
 6 6 0 0 0
SMALL
NO_CHARGES

@<TRIPOS>ATOM
      1 C1          0.0000    1.4000    0.0000 C.ar    1 LIG 0.000
      2 C2          1.2124    0.7000    0.0000 C.ar    1 LIG 0.000
      3 C3          1.2124   -0.7000    0.0000 C.ar    1 LIG 0.000
      4 C4          0.0000   -1.4000    0.0000 C.ar    1 LIG 0.000
      5 C5         -1.2124   -0.7000    0.0000 C.ar    1 LIG 0.000
      6 C6         -1.2124    0.7000    0.0000 C.ar    1 LIG 0.000
@<TRIPOS>BOND
     1     1     2    ar
     2     2     3    ar
     3     3     4    ar
     4     4     5    ar
     5     5     6    ar
     6     6     1    ar
